				"feats_script": "# King Konan of Brittany\ntime_bending = {\nicon = GFX_russkaya_pravda_34\nlevels = { 10 12 15 }\nupdate = {\nset_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 0 }\nif = { \nlimit = { dynasty = 22006 } # Rennes\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_rennes } # Roazhon 101\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_penthievre } # Domnoea 102\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_french_leon } # c_french_leon 103\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_cornouaille } # 104\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_vannes } # Broërec 105\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_nantes } # Naoned 106\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_tregor } # 1936\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_poher } # 1937\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_retz } # 1957\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_devon }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_cornwall }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_anjou }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_maine }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_avranches }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = { completely_controls = c_caen }\nchange_variable = { which = global_time_bending value = 1 }\n}\n}\n}\n}\ngloves_come_off = {\nicon = GFX_keeping_it_in_the_family_34\nlevels = { 2 3 5 }\nupdate = {\nset_variable = { which = global_gloves_come_off value = 0 }\nc_348 = { # King Konan of Brittany\nif = {\nlimit = { is_alive = yes } \nany_child = {\nif = {\nlimit = { \nNOT = { trait = bastard }\nis_female = no \n}\nchange_variable = { which = global_gloves_come_off value = 1 }\n} \n}\n}\n}\n}\n}\npreemtive_selfdefense = {\nicon = GFX_off_with_their_heads_34\nlevels = { 3 5 7 }\nupdate = {\nset_variable = { which = global_preemtive_selfdefense value = 0 }\nc_140 = { #duke William of de Normandie\nany_dynasty_member_even_if_dead = {\nif = {\nlimit = { \nis_alive = no\nkiller = { dynasty = 22006 }\n} \nchange_variable = { which = global_preemtive_selfdefense value = 1 }\n}\n}\n}\nc_140 = { #duke William of de Normandie\nif = {\nlimit = { \nis_alive = no\nkiller = { dynasty = 22006 }\n} \nchange_variable = { which = global_preemtive_selfdefense value = 1 }\n}\n}\n}\n}"
			},
			"add_localisation": [
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_konan_brittany_NAME;King Konan;Roi Conan;König Konan;;Rey Conan;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_konan_brittany_DESC;Remove the thorn while the rose is away!;Tenir la Rose en joue;Entfernt den Dorn, während die Rose weg ist!;;¡Quita la espina mientras la rosa se ausenta!;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_konan_brittany_PORTRAIT_INSTANT;§YKing Konan of Brittany§!;§YRoi Conan de Bretagne§!;§YKönig Konan der Bretagne§!;;§YRey Conan de Bretaña§!;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_konan_brittany_PORTRAIT_DELAYED;\"Konan II, Duke of Brittany would find himself in an uphill struggle to ensure his rule over Brittany. Having lost his father as a child, he faced many challenges to his rule from within and outside of his family. His uncle usurped his inheritance, and was later chained and imprisoned for his efforts. After becoming enthroned, he would face threats from William the Conqueror, later dying to suspectedly poisoned gloves while attempting to invade Anjou.\";\"Conan II, le duc de Bretagne s'est trouvé dans une lutte difficile pour assurer son autorité sur la Bretagne. Ayant perdu son père alors qu’il était enfant, il dût faire face à de nombreux défis, tant à l'extérieur de sa famille qu'à l'intérieur. Son oncle usurpa son héritage, puis fut enchaîné et emprisonné pour sa tentative. Après avoir été intronisé, Conan fera face aux menaces de Guillaume le Conquérant, mourant ensuite de gants supposés empoisonnés alors qu'il tentait d'envahir Anjou.\";\"Konan II, Herzog der Bretagne, würde sich in einem harten Kampf befinden, um seine Herrschaft über die Bretagne sicherzustellen. Nachdem er seinen Vater als Kind verloren hatte, sah er sich vielen Herausforderungen innerhalb und außerhalb seiner Familie gegenübergestellt. Sein Onkel übernahm sein Erbe und wurde später für seine Bemühungen in Ketten gelegt und eingesperrt. Nachdem er den Thron erklommen hatten, sah er sich der Bedrohung von Wilhelm dem Eroberer ausgesetzt, der später durch vergiftete Handschuhe starb, als er versuchte, Anjou zu überfallen.\";;\"Conan II, duque de Bretaña, tendría que luchar mucho para asegurar su dominio sobre Bretaña. Al perder a su padre cuando era niño, tuvo que enfrentarse a muchos desafíos a su reinado tanto dentro como fuera de su familia. Su tío usurpó su herencia, por lo que más tarde sería encadenado y encarcelado. Tras ascender al trono, se enfrentará a la amenaza de Guillermo el Conquistador para acabar muriendo, se supone que por unos guantes envenenados, cuando intentaba invadir Anjou.\";;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_time_bending_NAME;Time Bending;La courbure du temps;Zeitkrümmung;;Haciendo tiempo;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_time_bending_PROGRESS;Provinces Controlled;Provinces contrôlées;Kontrollierte Provinzen;;Prov. controladas;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_time_bending_DESC;Try to recreate Breton by controlling as many of these provinces as possible:\\n * Cornwall\\n * Devon\\n * Anjou\\n * Maine\\n * Mortain\\n * Caen\\n * Léon\\n * Kernev\\n * Poher\\n * Tregor\\n * Domnoea\\n * Broërec\\n * Roazhon\\n * Naoned\\n * Retz\\n * Progress continues for as long as you play the featured ruler's dynasty;Essayez de recréer les Bretons en contrôlant autant de ces provinces que possible :\\n * Cornwall\\n * Devon\\n * Anjou\\n * Maine\\n * Mortain\\n * Caen\\n * Léon\\n * Kernev\\n * Poher\\n * Tregor\\n * Domnoea\\n * Broërec\\n * Roazhon\\n * Naoned\\n * Retz\\n * La progression se poursuit tant que vous jouez la dynastie du dirigeant mis en avant;Versucht die Bretonen wiederaufzubauen, indem Ihr von den folgenden Provinzen so viele wie möglich kontrolliert:\\n * Cornwall\\n * Devon\\n * Anjou\\n * Maine\\n * Mortain\\n * Caen\\n * Léon\\n * Kernev\\n * Poher\\n * Tregor\\n * Domnoea\\n * Broërec\\n * Roazhon\\n * Naoned\\n * Retz\\n * Der Fortschritt geht solange weiter, wie Ihr die vorgestellte Herrscher-Dynastie spielt;;¡Recrea Bretaña controlando tantas provincias de estas como puedas!:\\n * Cornualles\\n * Devon\\n * Anjou\\n * Maine\\n * Mortain\\n * Caen\\n * Léon\\n * Kernev\\n * Poher\\n * Tregor\\n * Domnoea\\n * Broërec\\n * Roazhon\\n * Naoned\\n * Retz\\n * El progreso seguirá mientras juegues con la dinastía del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_time_bending_fail;Starting province lost!;Province de départ perdue!;Startprovinz verloren!;;¡Provincia inicial perdida!;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_time_bending_counting;Starting provinces not yet lost.;Provinces de départ pas encore perdues.;Startprovinz noch nicht verloren.;;Provincias iniciales aún no perdidas.;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_gloves_come_off_NAME;Gloves Come Off!;Ne pas prendre de gants;Handschuhe lösten sich!;;¡Sin miramientos!;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_gloves_come_off_PROGRESS;Number of Sons Alive;Nombre de fils en vie;Anzahl lebender Söhne;;Hijos vivos;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_gloves_come_off_DESC;Historically, King Konan is said to have died due to poisoned gloves. Ensure that King Konan has a male heir and a few to spare! Non-legitimized sons do not count.\\n * The challenge is only accomplishable with the featured ruler during their lifetime;Historiquement, le roi Conan serait mort à cause de gants empoisonnés. Assurez-vous qu'il ait un héritier et même plusieurs! Les fils non légitimés ne comptent pas.\\n * L’exploit est réalisable uniquement avec le dirigeant mis en avant;Historisch soll König Konan an vergifteten Handschuhen gestorben sein. Stellt sicher, dass König Konan einen männlichen Erben und einige weitere Erben in der Reserve hat! Nicht legitime Söhne zählen nicht.\\n * Diese Herausforderung ist nur mit dem vorgestellten Herrscher zu Lebzeiten erreichbar;;La historia dice que Conan murió por unos guantes envenenados. ¡Asegúrate de que el duque tiene un heredero varón y de repuesto! Los hijos ilegítimos no cuentan.\\n * Logro solo realizable en vida del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_preemtive_selfdefense_NAME;Pre-Emptive Self-Defense;Autodéfense préventive;Präventive Selbstverteidigung;;Autodefensa preventiva;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_preemtive_selfdefense_PROGRESS;Members of Williams Dynasty Killed;Nombre de tués de la dynastie de Guillaume;Getötete Mitglieder von Williams Dynastie;;Muertos de la dinastía de Guillermo;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_preemtive_selfdefense_DESC;Have you and your dynasty members kill as many of William of de Normandie's dynasty members as possible. Killing William himself gives 2 points!\\n * Progress continues for as long as you play the featured ruler's dynasty;Vous et les membres de votre dynastie devez tuer autant de membres de la dynastie de Guillaume de Normandie que possible. Tuer Guillaume donne 2 points!\\n * La progression se poursuit tant que vous jouez la dynastie du dirigeant mis en avant;Tötet selbst oder lasst Eure Dynastiemitglieder so viele Mitglieder der Dynastie von Wilhelm der Normandie wie möglich töten. William selbst zu töten gibt 2 Punkte!\\n * Der Fortschritt geht solange weiter, wie Ihr die vorgestellte Herrscher-Dynastie spielt;;Haz que los miembros de tu dinastía maten a todos los que puedan de la dinastía normanda de Guillermo. ¡Matar al mismo Guillermo da dos puntos!\\n * El progreso seguirá mientras juegues con la dinastía del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;x"
			]
		},
