				"feats_script": "#Kulin Kulinic \nnot_so_land_locked = {\nicon = GFX_dream_home_34\nhappened = {\ncompletely_controls = k_bosnia\nhas_landed_title = k_bosnia\nindependent = yes\ndynasty = 183\n}\n}\nheretical_company = { \nicon = GFX_prodigous_five_34\nlevels = { 6 9 12 }\nupdate = {\nset_variable = { which = global_heretical_company value = 0 }\nif = {\nlimit = { dynasty = 183 }\nif = { \nlimit = { is_heretic = yes}\nchange_variable = { which = global_heretical_company value = 1 }\n}\nany_courtier_or_vassal = { \nif = { \nlimit = { \nis_heretic = yes\nprisoner = no\n}\nchange_variable = { which = global_heretical_company value = 1 }\n}\n}\n}\n}\n}\nindependence_day = {\nicon = GFX_stargazer_34\nlevels = { 4 8 12 }\nupdate = {\nif = {\nlimit = {\nOR = {\nNAND = {\ndynasty = 183\nindependent = yes\nin_revolt = no\nwar = no\n}\ncheck_variable = { which = global_character_died value = 1 }\n}\n}\nset_variable = { which = global_independence_day value = 0 }\nset_variable = { which = global_character_died value = 0 }\n}\nif = {\nlimit = {\ndynasty = 183\nindependent = yes\nin_revolt = no\nwar = no\n}\nif = {\nlimit = {\nNOT = { has_character_flag = independence_day_tracker }\n}\nset_character_flag = independence_day_tracker\n}\nif = {\nlimit = {\nhad_character_flag = { flag = independence_day_tracker days = 365 }\n}\nchange_variable = { which = global_independence_day value = 1 }\nclr_character_flag = independence_day_tracker\n}\n}\nexport_to_variable = { which = current_day_of_birth value = day_of_birth }\nexport_to_variable = { which = current_month_of_birth value = month_of_birth }\nexport_to_variable = { which = current_year_of_birth value = year_of_birth }\nif = {\nlimit = {\nNAND = {\ncheck_variable = { which = stored_day_of_birth which == current_day_of_birth }\ncheck_variable = { which = stored_month_of_birth which == current_month_of_birth }\ncheck_variable = { which = stored_year_of_birth which == current_year_of_birth }\n}\n}\nexport_to_variable = { which = stored_day_of_birth value = day_of_birth }\nexport_to_variable = { which = stored_month_of_birth value = month_of_birth }\nexport_to_variable = { which = stored_year_of_birth value = year_of_birth }\nchange_variable = { which = global_character_died value = 1 }\n}\n}\n}"
			},
			"add_localisation": [
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_kulin_bosnia_NAME;Doux Kulin;Doux Kulin;Doux Kulin;;Dux Kulin;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_kulin_bosnia_DESC;Bring Peace to Bosnia and become a hero!;Apportez la paix en Bosnie et devenez un héros !;Bringt Bosnien den Frieden und werdet zum Helden!;;!Lleva la paz a Bosnia y conviértete en un héroe!;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_kulin_bosnia_PORTRAIT_INSTANT;§YDoux Kulin of Bosnia§!;§YDoux Kulin de Bosnie§!;§YDoux Kulin von Bosnien§!;;§YDux Kulin de Bosnia§!;;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"HIGHLIGHTED_RULER_kulin_bosnia_PORTRAIT_DELAYED;\"Kulin of Bosnia was the man who would lead Bosnia through the Bosnian Age of Peace and Prosperity, responsible for creating a de facto independent state. Often regarded as a hero of Bosnia, his leadership was not without difficulty, with Kulin often having to find political balance between the powers of Hungary, Serbia and the Pope.\";\"Kulin de Bosnie était l'homme qui dirigerait la Bosnie pendant l'ère de la paix et de la prospérité en Bosnie, chargé de créer un État de facto indépendant. Souvent considéré comme un héros de la Bosnie, son règne a souvent dû trouver un équilibre politique entre les puissances de la Hongrie, de la Serbie et du pape.\";\"Kulin von Bosnien war der Mann, der Bosnien durch das bosnische Zeitalter des Friedens und des Wohlstands führen würde und für die Schaffung eines faktisch unabhängigen Staates verantwortlich war. Oft als ein Held Bosniens betrachtet, war seine Führung nicht ohne Schwierigkeiten und oft ohne ein politisches Gleichgewicht zwischen den beiden die Mächte Ungarns, Serbiens und des Papstes.\";;\"Kulin de Bosnia fue el quien guiaría a Bosnia por su edad de paz y prosperidad, el responsable de crear un estado independiente de facto. A menudo considerado un héroe bosnio, su liderazgo no estuvo carente de dificultades, teniendo que encontrar a menudo un equilibrio político entre los poderes de Hungría, Serbia y el papa.\";;;;;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_not_so_land_locked_NAME;Not-So Landlocked;Pas si enclavé;Nicht nur von Land umschlossen;;Con algún litoral;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_not_so_land_locked_DESC;Rule an independent Kingdom of Bosnia! You must:\n* Hold the Kingdom of Bosnia\n* Completely control all its de jure provinces\n* Be independent \n* Progress continues for as long as you play the featured ruler's dynasty;Régnez sur un royaume de Bosnie indépendant !\n* Vous devez détenir le titre de roi de Bosnie et être indépendant.\n* La progression se poursuit tant que vous jouez la dynastie du dirigeant mis en avant.;Beherrscht ein unabhängiges Königreich Bosnien!\n* Ihr müsst den Titel des Königs von Bosnien tragen und unabhängig sein.\n* Der Fortschritt geht solange weiter, wie Ihr die vorgestellte Herrscher-Dynastie spielt;;¡Gobierna en un Reino de Bosnia independiente!\n* Debes poseer el título de Rey de Bosnia y ser independiente. \n* El progreso continuará mientras juegues con la dinastía del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_not_so_land_locked_PROGRESS;King of Bosnia;Roi de Bosnie;König von Bosnien;;Rey de Bosnia;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_heretical_company_NAME;Heretical Company;Compagnie hérétique;Häretische Gesellschaft;;Compañía hereje;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_heretical_company_DESC;Have as many courtiers as possible who openly practise a heretical belief! \n* Prisoners don't count! \n* Progress continues for as long as you play the featured ruler's dynasty;Ayez autant de courtisans que possible qui pratiquent ouvertement une croyance hérétique !\n* Les prisonniers ne comptent pas !\n* La progression se poursuit tant que vous jouez la dynastie du dirigeant mis en avant.;Habt so viele Höflinge wie möglich, die offen einem häretischen Glauben folgen!\n* Gefangene zählen nicht!\n* Der Fortschritt geht solange weiter, wie Ihr die vorgestellte Herrscher-Dynastie spielt;;¡Ten todos los cortesanos que practiquen abiertamente creencias heréticas que puedas! \n* ¡Los prisioneros no cuentan! \n* El progreso continuará mientras juegues con la dinastía del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_heretical_company_PROGRESS;Heretical Courtiers;Courtisans hérétiques;Häretische Höflinge;;Cortesanos heréticos;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_independence_day_NAME;Celebrating our Independence Day!;Célébrer notre indépendance !;Feiern unserer Unabhängigkeit!;;¡Celebrando la independencia!;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_independence_day_DESC;As an independent realm, remain at peace and independence for as long as possible!\n* Progress resets on character death and when entering a war\n* Progress continues for as long as you play the featured ruler's dynasty;Restez en paix et indépendant le plus longtemps possible !\n* Le progrès est réinitialisé à la mort du personnage et lorsqu'il entre en guerre\n* La progression se poursuit tant que vous jouez la dynastie du dirigeant mis en avant.;Bleibt als unabhängiges Reich solange im Frieden und unabhängig wie möglich;;¡Como reino independiente, mantente en paz e independiente todo lo que puedas!\n* El progreso continuará mientras juegues con la dinastía del gobernante presentado;;;;;;;;;x",
				"RULER_FEAT_independence_day_PROGRESS;Years of Peace;Années de paix;Jahre im Frieden;;Años de paz;;;;;;;;;x"
			]
